{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S08—S12几个短停留段，话语和感受交替出现的项目偏多，尤其S11、S13，扫读压力明显高于X，容易顾不上听音乐。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更密，但【】突出关键心理信息，感受文字较小且按音乐进程出现，能让观众把人物心境和具体音乐变化联系起来，而不是面对一堆同时出现的情绪标签。尤其是舍不得亲近、记恨受气、害怕孤独、犹豫是否回去之间的矛盾，Y交代得更完整，前后心理转变也更有层次。X确实更容易快速扫读，但部分音乐感受被压缩成泛化短词，人物心理和音乐细节之间的对应关系不如Y清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "586dc0f7-f4cd-449d-aea5-0367da55894a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005555010352Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:57:14.268377+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "10a4001c6de3f1ea101b6889140570df6691b3eed1c238b6cc5144f4e59efbfc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp